WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.000
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.390
You are not Batman!

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:10.370
Dr. Bright may possess some unusual abilities,
namely the fact that he can never die, but

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:12.759
that does not make him a superhero.

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:17.080
No matter what he might tell any gullible
new interns, he is not a Doctor By Day and

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.240
Crimefighter By Night, nor does he "dwell
in the shadows."

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:26.359
He also does not own any of the following:
A bright-mobile, brighterangs, a bright-claw,

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.720
a bright-suit, or a baseball-bright.

